### 1) login
POST http://localhost:6565/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "admin",
  "username": "admin",
  "credential": "admin123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.data.token);
%}

### 2) sleep-batch（含不存在ID）
POST http://localhost:6565/api/admin/agents/sleep-batch
Content-Type: application/json
X-Admin-Token: {{token}}

{
  "agentIds": [2074659521706500097, 2074738200998518786, 2074741030123651073, 99999999],
  "reason": "批次3端到端验证"
}

### 5) wake 单个（验证 wake + operator 修复）
PUT http://localhost:6565/api/admin/agents/2074659521706500097/wake
Content-Type: application/json
X-Admin-Token: {{token}}

{
  "reason": "批次3 wake 验证"
}

### 6) sleep-batch（operator 修复后重跑：1 wake→OFFLINE + 1 SLEEPING→failed + 1 OFFLINE→success + 1 不存在）
POST http://localhost:6565/api/admin/agents/sleep-batch
Content-Type: application/json
X-Admin-Token: {{token}}

{
  "agentIds": [2074659521706500097, 2074741030123651073, 2074738923341537281, 99999999],
  "reason": "批次3 operator 修复验证"
}

### 7) sleeping?role=EXECUTOR（最终状态）
GET http://localhost:6565/api/admin/agents/sleeping?role=EXECUTOR
X-Admin-Token: {{token}}

### 8) sleeping (no role)
GET http://localhost:6565/api/admin/agents/sleeping
X-Admin-Token: {{token}}